<title>USA: U.S. cotton weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. cotton weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. upland cotton major sales activity in the week ended Aug 22 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in 1,000 running bales:</p>
<p> Net Sales:   1996/97	   1997/98</p>
<p>  Indonesia    9,800		Nil</p>
<p>  China	  6,300</p>
<p>  S. Korea     5,400</p>
<p>  Hong Kong    5,200</p>
<p>  Japan	  5,100</p>
<p>  Mexico	 5,000</p>
<p>Note: weekly exports of 29,000 running bales were down 57 percent from previous week and off 34 percent from four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Asia, Western Hemisphere, and western Europe.</p>
</text>
